<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= @program_title %> — anteprima</title>
  <style>
    :root { --ink:#17212b; --muted:#6b7280; --line:#dbe3e8; --canvas:#f5f7f7; --paper:#fff; --teal:#0f766e; --mass:#2b193d; --move:#0f766e; --medit:#b42318; }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; } body { margin:0; background:var(--canvas); color:var(--ink); font:13px/1.35 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; } main { max-width:850px; margin:auto; padding:31px 20px 50px; }
    .brand { color:var(--teal); font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.11em; font-weight:800; } h1 { margin:5px 0 3px; font-size:27px; letter-spacing:-.045em; } .intro { margin:0; color:var(--muted); } .course { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:7px; margin:20px 0 24px; } .course span { padding:5px 8px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:7px; background:#fff; color:#475569; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }
    ol { list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; } li { display:flex; gap:12px; } .rail { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:30px; flex-shrink:0; } .number { display:grid; place-items:center; width:29px; height:29px; border:1px solid #b7c6cf; border-radius:50%; background:#fff; color:#334155; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; } .line { width:1px; min-height:22px; flex:1; margin-top:5px; background:#cad5dc; } li:last-child .line { display:none; }
    .lesson { flex:1; min-width:0; padding:0 0 18px; } .session { display:grid; grid-template-columns:84px 1fr 1fr; gap:10px; padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:9px 9px 0 0; background:#fff; } .field label { display:block; color:var(--muted); font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; font-weight:800; } .blank { display:block; min-height:18px; padding-top:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3e8; color:#94a3b8; font-size:11px; } .time { display:flex; gap:6px; } .time .blank { flex:1; } .where { grid-column:span 2; } .choices { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; padding-top:3px; color:#475569; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; } .box { display:inline-block; width:12px; height:12px; border:1px solid #94a3b8; margin-right:3px; vertical-align:-2px; border-radius:2px; }
    .sheets { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:8px; padding:9px 12px 11px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-top:0; border-radius:0 0 9px 9px; background:#fbfdfe; } .sheet { display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr; gap:7px; align-items:center; min-width:0; padding:6px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:7px; background:var(--paper); } .sheet-icon { display:grid; place-items:center; width:31px; height:31px; border-radius:50%; } .sheet-icon img { width:23px; height:23px; object-fit:contain; } .sheet.massaggio .sheet-icon { background:#e9def5; } .sheet.movimento .sheet-icon { background:#ccfbf1; } .sheet.meditazione .sheet-icon { background:#fee4e2; } .sheet b { display:block; font-size:10px; } .sheet.massaggio b { color:var(--mass); } .sheet.movimento b { color:var(--move); } .sheet.meditazione b { color:var(--medit); } .sheet .blank { font-size:10px; min-height:15px; } .sheet-number { color:#94a3b8; font-size:9px; } .missing { color:#94a3b8; font-size:11px; }
    .training .number { color:#6d28d9; border-color:#a78bfa; } .training .session { background:#fcfaff; } .hint { margin:14px 0 0 42px; padding:9px 11px; border-left:2px solid var(--teal); background:#ecfdf9; color:#115e59; font-size:11px; }
    @media(max-width:580px) { main { padding:26px 14px 42px; } .sheets { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <% area_icons = {
    "massaggio" => "https://ik.imagekit.io/posturacorretta/immagini_brand/5%20aree/massaggio.png",
    "movimento" => "https://ik.imagekit.io/posturacorretta/immagini_brand/5%20aree/movimento.png",
    "meditazione" => "https://ik.imagekit.io/posturacorretta/immagini_brand/5%20aree/meditazione.png"
  } %>
  <main>
    <div class="brand">PosturaCorretta · anteprima privata</div>
    <h1>Programma lezioni</h1>
    <p class="intro">Ogni incontro è una riga con tre schede: massaggio, movimento e meditazione.</p>
    <div class="course"><span><%= @program_title %></span><span>Studente: ____________________</span><span>Insegnante responsabile: ____________________</span></div>
    <ol aria-label="Lezioni del programma studenti">
      <% @program_lessons.each do |lesson| %>
        <li class="<%= "training" if lesson.fetch("kind") == "tirocinio" %>">
          <div class="rail"><span class="number"><%= format("%02d", lesson.fetch("number")) %></span><span class="line"></span></div>
          <div class="lesson">
            <div class="session">
              <div class="field"><label>Data</label><span class="blank">___ / ___ / ____</span></div>
              <div class="field"><label>Ora</label><div class="time"><span class="blank">inizio</span><span class="blank">fine</span></div></div>
              <div class="field"><label>Modalità</label><div class="choices"><span><i class="box"></i>Gruppo</span><span><i class="box"></i>Singolo</span></div></div>
              <div class="field where"><label>Luogo</label><div class="choices"><span><i class="box"></i>Centro</span><span><i class="box"></i>Domicilio</span><span><i class="box"></i>Online</span></div><span class="blank">Nome del luogo / indirizzo / collegamento online</span></div>
              <div class="field"><label>Insegnante</label><span class="blank">Nome e cognome</span></div>
              <div class="field"><label>N. scheda insegnante</label><span class="blank">__________</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sheets">
              <% lesson.fetch("sheets").each do |sheet| %>
                <% area = sheet.fetch("section") %>
                <article class="sheet <%= area %>">
                  <span class="sheet-icon"><img src="<%= sheet["image"].presence || area_icons.fetch(area) %>" alt=""></span>
                  <div>
                    <b><%= area.humanize %></b>
                    <span class="sheet-number">N. scheda: <%= sheet.fetch("number") %></span>
                    <span class="blank"><%= sheet.fetch("title") %></span>
                  </div>
                </article>
              <% end %>
              <% if lesson.fetch("sheets").empty? %><span class="missing">Schede da collegare.</span><% end %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ol>
    <p class="hint">Il programma non assegna date da solo. Data, orario, luogo, modalità e insegnante vengono compilati quando l’incontro è programmato per un gruppo, un domicilio, online o una lezione singola.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
